# BananaOS UI Rule

Original BananaOS design — premium mobile polish without copying Apple UI.

## Design Tokens

- Accent: `banana-gold` · Background: `black` / `bg-white/5` · Borders: `border-white/10`
- Glass: `backdrop-blur-xl` + `bg-white/5` or `bg-black/90`
- Typography: `text-[10px]` labels (uppercase tracking-widest), `text-sm` body, `text-2xl` hero numbers
- Radius: `rounded-xl` cards, `rounded-2xl` panels, `rounded-3xl` dock

## Reuse Before Creating

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Glass card | `GlassPanel` from `@/components/ui/GlassPanel` |
| Button | `Button` from `@/components/shared/Button` |
| Empty state | `EmptyState` from `@/components/shared/EmptyState` |
| App icon | `AppIcon` from `@/components/os/AppIcon` |
| Phone frame | `PhoneFrame` layout |

## App Shell Pattern

```tsx
// Header
<p className="text-banana-gold text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase">App Name</p>
<p className="text-white/40 text-[9px]">Official BananaOS Application</p>

// Card
<div className="bg-gradient-to-br from-banana-gold/15 via-black/70 to-black/90 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-2xl border border-banana-gold/20 p-5" />
```

## Required States

Every screen: loading spinner (`border-banana-gold`), empty state, error feedback. No blank screens.

## Tab Bars

Spring tab indicator with `layoutId`, `framer-motion` scale on active icon. See `BankTabBar.tsx` / `ContactsTabBar.tsx`.

## Don't

- Hardcode colors outside design tokens
- Duplicate shared components per app
- Ship placeholder "Coming soon" UI
